<name>Control System</name>
<section id="1001O_S001F" variety="S001F">
<name>Cruise Control</name>
<ttl id="1001O_S001F_74QXD_T00FC" variety="T00FC">
<name>Radar Cruise Control System</name>
<para id="RM000000DDY00DX" category="C" type-id="304CK" name-id="59159-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>U0100/77</dtccode>
<dtcname>Engine ECU Communication Malfunction</dtcname>
<dtccode>U0100/78</dtccode>
<dtcname>Engine ECU Communication Malfunction</dtcname>
<dtccode>U0122/82</dtccode>
<dtcname>VSC (ECB) ECU Communication Malfunction</dtcname>
<dtccode>U0123/84</dtccode>
<dtcname>Yaw Rate Sensor Communication Malfunction</dtcname>
<dtccode>U0126/79</dtccode>
<dtcname>Steering Angle Sensor Communication Malfunction</dtcname>
<dtccode>U1101/81</dtccode>
<dtcname>Distance Control ECU Communication Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000000DDY00DX_07" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CBJ00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The engine control computer communicates information with each ECU via CAN communication. A DTC is output when communication with an ECU cannot be established.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Diagnosis Condition</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Abnormal Condition</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>U0100/77</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Control vehicle speed (40 - 100 km/h), cruise control main switch ON (vehicle-to-vehicle distance control mode)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Communication data from the engine control computer to the distance control computer assembly is interrupted</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Distance Control Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>CAN Communication System</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>U0100/78</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Control vehicle speed (40 - 100 km/h), cruise control main switch ON (vehicle-to-vehicle distance control mode)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Communication data from the engine control computer to the ABS &amp; traction actuator assembly is interrupted</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ABS &amp; Traction Actuator Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>CAN Communication System</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>U0122/82</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Control vehicle speed (40 - 100 km/h), cruise control main switch ON (vehicle-to-vehicle distance control mode)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Communication data from the ABS &amp; traction actuator assembly to the engine control computer is interrupted</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ABS &amp; Traction Actuator Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>CAN Communication System</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>U0123/84</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>During cruise control (vehicle-to-vehicle distance control mode)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Communication data from the yaw rate sensor assembly to the engine control computer is interrupted</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Yaw Rate Sensor</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Distance Control Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>CAN Communication System</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>U0126/79</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>During cruise control (vehicle-to-vehicle distance control mode)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Communication data from the steering sensor to the engine control computer is interrupted</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Steering Sensor</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Distance Control Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>CAN Communication System</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>U1101/81</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Control vehicle speed (40 - 100 km/h), cruise control main switch ON (vehicle-to-vehicle distance control mode)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Communication data from the distance control computer assembly to the engine control computer is interrupted</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Engine Control Computer</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Distance Control Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>CAN Communication System</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000DDY00DX_03" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000000DDY00DX_06" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000000DDY00DX_06_0012" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CHY00000">
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000064C00EX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000DDY00DX_06_0010" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000DDY00DX_06_0010" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CBI00000">
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Put the vehicle in the conditions under which the DTC is detected.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>The system cannot detect the malfunction unless the detection conditions are met.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test2>
<ptxt>Drive within the cruise control set vehicle speed range.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Turn the cruise control main switch ON and put the system in vehicle-to-vehicle distance control mode standby.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000064C00EX"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.90in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.23in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>CAN communication system malfunction DTCs are output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>CAN communication system malfunction DTCs are not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000000DDY00DX_06_0011" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM000000DDY00DX_06_0013" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000DDY00DX_06_0011">
<testtitle>Go to CAN Communication System<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005RZ01VX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000000DDY00DX_06_0013">
<testtitle>Perform Problem Reproduction Test<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000ABY04BX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
